2. Permission to use

You may download, install, and run an unmodified official release of the
Software for personal, non-commercial use.

You may show gameplay, screenshots, reviews, or videos made using an
unmodified official release. Where the use is public, provide reasonable
attribution in the description, credits, or another clearly associated place:

    <Product name> by Oliver - https://erydon.co.uk

Private play does not require a public attribution notice. Ordinary game
configuration and the use of separate compatible mods or resource packs do
not modify the Software.

3. Free modpacks

You may include an exact, unmodified official release of the Software in a
modpack only when all of the following are true:

- the modpack is free to download and use;
- no payment, subscription, donation, or paid early access is required to
  obtain the Software;
- this licence and any separate licence or attribution notices remain intact;
- the modpack credits the product as described in section 2; and
- the modpack links to an official distribution page when reasonably possible.

This permission does not allow a standalone mirror or re-host of the Software.

